    "title": "MICROSERVICE_PROD_Repayment Schedules Management API",
    "description": "The Repayment Schedules Management API enables the creation of customized repayment schedules for specific loans. By submitting a request to this endpoint, users can establish tailored payment plans that align with borrower needs and obligations. This API is particularly useful for financial institutions and loan servicers looking to enhance their loan management functionalities. Typical consumers include financial institutions, loan officers, and developers creating financial applications.",
