        "summary": "Create a new repayment schedule for a specific loan.",
        "description": "This endpoint allows the user to create a repayment schedule for the specified loan identified by its loan ID. It takes the necessary details for the repayment schedule as input and returns the verification of creation along with the new schedule details.",
